messageID = 10
title = "Mysterious Note"
message = "*There are crude drawings of what seems to be food with tally marks next to it, it describes*

[Fish over fire] 20 tally marks
[A Pumpkin] 10 tally marks
[A Cabbage] 10 tally marks and
[A Carrot] 10 tally marks

*Some words can also be understood*

No Energy, Can't Move, Will die in winter.
"
